WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome!
-How are you?

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m wonderful.
I´m so happy to have you here.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this book comes on the cusp
of your 10-year

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
anniversary of your brand.
-Yes.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Congratulations.
10 years is amazing.

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.444 size:84% position:42%
Thank you. Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This book has a lot
of your designs,

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of behind
the scenes stuff.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
What did you set out to do
with this book?

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.717
-Yeah. I mean, it´s 10 years.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.020 size:84% position:42%
It´s a lot of pieces,
but I really wanted to,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, it´s time
for kind of escapism.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.790
So I wanted people to feel like
they open this book,

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.326
they feel like they´re in a kind
of a a dream fantasy world.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
So whatever you´re
kind of feeling,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.096
you kind of just transform
yourself into a new place.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s wonderful.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What a nice thing
for a book to do for you.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.733 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, yeah. exactly.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, you know,
because I didn´t really

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
write a lot in it.
It´s very visual.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-So I felt like I wanted to,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
just make people feel good

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.611
and, you know, there´s a lot
of beautiful things in there

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we worked on
over the years

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
that maybe people
didn´t love in the beginning.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I´m glad that we were
able to show them.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One of -- you have a
design of a dress you made

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
for Leslie Jones.
You dressed her.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-You continue to dress her.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But the relationship --

00:00:56.723 --> 00:01:00.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
your relationship with Leslie
started via social media.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you tell us this story?
-It did.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.497
-You know, Leslie for her
"Ghostbusters" premier,

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.865 size:84% position:42%
which was a huge movie.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.534
You know, she was having a hard
time finding a dress,

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:10.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I thought was crazy,
´cause she´s amazing.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes, she is.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She really is.
I mean, she´s so amazing.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just thought
that was crazy.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.343
And, yeah, I just responded
with emojis, little hands.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "Hi. I´m here.
I´m happy to dress you."

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, um, and it was really
just casual.

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:24.284
I just really wanted to make
something beautiful for her,

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.985 size:84% position:42%
And then we hit it off.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think she killed it
on the carpet.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:29.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
She had her
"Pretty Woman" moment.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:30.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And looked stunning.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:33.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then in turn,
she then went to

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of your fashion shows.
-She did.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:38.231
-This was the first fashion show
that Leslie had ever been to.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was.
-And, um...

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-...she was very unique.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were you happy to have someone
with Leslie´s energy

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
at one of your fashion shows?
-I was.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:50.310
At first, I thought someone
fell and hurt themselves

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.546
because she was screaming
so loud that I just was like...

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, and then she came in
the next day.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:56.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were fitting her for the
Emmys and she was like,

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Baby, I thought I was at
the Knicks game."

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "okay."
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, I just don´t think
she knew what it was

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
supposed to be.
-Well, I have to think...

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you guys...
-But I loved it.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.759
-I´ve been to fashion shows.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
You do so much work...
-Yeah.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.663
-...and people walk out
in these stunning dresses

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
and no one reacts.
-Yeah, it´s...

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s very what
you would expect.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:16.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are very --
they´re almost trying to stay

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
as very still,
because they will also

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:19.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
be in backgrounds
of photographs.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
And so everyone is posing.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I was --
when I watched this video,

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.810
I was very happy with how...

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought this was
a nice change up

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:26.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
to what you expect
at fashion shows.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take a look here.

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:30.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whoo!

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:32.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes!

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s right.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come on, now.
come on, now.

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whoo!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Screams ]

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.699 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.369 size:88% position:44%
-I mean, it was amazing.

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:50.637
I mean, I just loved it so much

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:52.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
because Coco Rocha
was the model there,

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she was like,
"I love Coco so much!"

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:57.477
And I just love her
like grabbing like Gina Gershon

00:02:57.477 --> 00:03:00.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Patricia Clarkson
who were like, "Who is she?"

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:01.748
You know, so it was just so...

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.650
But it made, I think,
everybody in the room just like,

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.885 size:84% position:42%
all the fashion people,
who are so annoying,

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
it just made them, like,
kind of like, let go

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:09.422
and remember that fashion

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
should be fun
and that´s the whole point.

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s what this
whole book is about --

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.359
that fashion should be fun.

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
It should be easy
to get dressed.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s, like,
the whole point of it.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:19.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Someone who I know
to be a big fan of yours

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:22.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
and who also thought you were
a lot of fun as a person

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
to watch on television
was Amy Poehler.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.272
And I remember working at "SNL"
and Amy Poehler

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
did an impression of you
on the show.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.909
-She did.
-And she ran into you the night

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
before she did it
on television, right?

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:34.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, yeah. and I was like --
I was like, 20 years old.

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:36.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn´t really know
what "SNL" was.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:38.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don´t judge me.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.286
And I was like a naive kid.

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:42.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I remember her
being nervous and thinking

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.190
I was, like, going to judge her.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "No, I´m --
I mean, what an honor."

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:48.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I was a kid.
I was so excited.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:51.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was, I mean, amazing.
I mean...

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:52.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, here´s just a,
first of all,

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
that´s what you looked like
10 years ago.

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh, yeah.
-And --

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:59.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I look the same.
-And there is Amy Poehler

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:04.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
doing a very, a pretty good,
a pretty good impression.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:07.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I let her borrow my wig.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:09.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, no. I mean,
it was amazing.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:12.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was so -- it was really
such a funny sketch.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:16.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I mean, she´s amazing
and so funny.

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.925
-Well, you have excellent taste
in comedians.

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:20.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Clearly.
-From Poehler to Leslie,

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:23.096
and congratulations on 10 years
and congratulations on the book.

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:24.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much
for having me.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:25.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It really is wonderful.
-Thank you.

